msgstr "교육 자료(동영상 및 프레젠테이션):"

#: temp.glade:40097
msgid "Videos via Paratext"
msgstr "Paratext의 동영상"

#: temp.glade:40104
msgid "There is a growing range of videos\n"
"to teach you how to use some of\n"
"the more advanced features of\n"
"this very powerful software.\n"
"\n"
"The videos on the Paratext site are\n"
"high-quality and carefully curated,\n"
"but they may not always cover the\n"
"latest features available in PTXprint."
msgstr "이 강력한 소프트웨어의 고급 기능 사용법을\n"
